  "headHtml": "\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<meta content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\" name=\"viewport\"/>\n<title>Travel Log — NIGHT</title>\n<meta content=\"NIGHT TRAVEL LOG — Los Angeles, Las Vegas, New York. 무대 밖 다섯 멤버의 여행 기록.\" name=\"description\"/>\n<link href=\"assets/css/style.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n",
  "beforeHeaderHtml": "\n",
  "contentHtml": "\n<main>\n<section class=\"travel-hero\">\n<img alt=\"NIGHT 멤버들의 여행 출발 기록\" class=\"travel-hero-image\" src=\"assets/images/travel/full/01-incheon-airport.webp\"/>\n<div class=\"travel-hero-shade\"></div>\n<div class=\"travel-hero-copy container\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">OFFICIAL OFF-STAGE ARCHIVE</p>\n<h1>NIGHT<br/><span>TRAVEL LOG</span></h1>\n<p class=\"travel-hero-line\">OFF THE STAGE, INTO THE CITY.</p>\n<p class=\"travel-route\">LOS ANGELES <i>·</i> LAS VEGAS <i>·</i> NEW YORK</p>\n<a class=\"travel-scroll-link\" href=\"#departure\">BEGIN THE JOURNEY <span>↓</span></a>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<nav aria-label=\"여행 챕터\" class=\"travel-chapter-nav\">\n<div class=\"container\"><a href=\"#departure\">01 DEPARTURE</a><a href=\"#los-angeles\">02 LOS ANGELES</a><a href=\"#las-vegas\">03 LAS VEGAS</a><a href=\"#new-york\">04 NEW YORK</a><a href=\"#return\">05 RETURN</a><a href=\"#epilogue\">EPILOGUE</a></div>\n</nav>\n\n<section class=\"travel-chapter section\" id=\"departure\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"travel-chapter-head reveal\"><div><span>CHAPTER 01</span><h2>Departure</h2></div><p>THE JOURNEY BEGINS BEFORE THE CITY WAKES.</p></div>\n<div class=\"travel-grid\">\n<button class=\"travel-photo travel-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/01-incheon-airport.webp\" data-title=\"INCHEON · THE BEGINNING\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"인천공항에서 여행을 시작하는 NIGHT\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/01-incheon-airport.webp\"/><span><b>INCHEON</b><small>THE BEGINNING</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/02-departure-checkin.webp\" data-title=\"DEPARTURE · CHECK-IN\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"출국 수속 중인 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/02-departure-checkin.webp\"/><span><b>DEPARTURE</b><small>CHECK-IN</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/03-boarding.webp\" data-title=\"DEPARTURE · BOARDING\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"비행기에 탑승하는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/03-boarding.webp\"/><span><b>DEPARTURE</b><small>BOARDING</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/04-private-flight.webp\" data-title=\"ABOVE THE CLOUDS\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"비행 중인 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/04-private-flight.webp\"/><span><b>FLIGHT</b><small>ABOVE THE CLOUDS</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/05-arrival-gate.webp\" data-title=\"ARRIVAL · FIRST STEP\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"도착 게이트의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/05-arrival-gate.webp\"/><span><b>ARRIVAL</b><small>FIRST STEP</small></span></button>\n</div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"travel-chapter section\" id=\"los-angeles\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"travel-chapter-head reveal\"><div><span>CHAPTER 02</span><h2>Los Angeles</h2></div><p>SUNLIGHT LOOKS DIFFERENT ON US.</p></div>\n<div class=\"travel-grid\">\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/06-la-hotel.webp\" data-title=\"LOS ANGELES · HOTEL\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"로스앤젤레스 호텔의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/06-la-hotel.webp\"/><span><b>LOS ANGELES</b><small>HOTEL</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo travel-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/07-hotel-pool.webp\" data-title=\"LOS ANGELES · POOLSIDE\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"호텔 수영장의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/07-hotel-pool.webp\"/><span><b>LOS ANGELES</b><small>POOLSIDE</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/08-disneyland-arrival.webp\" data-title=\"DISNEYLAND · ARRIVAL\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"디즈니랜드에 도착한 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/08-disneyland-arrival.webp\"/><span><b>DISNEYLAND</b><small>ARRIVAL</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo travel-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/09-disneyland-together.webp\" data-title=\"DISNEYLAND · FIVE OF US\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"디즈니랜드에서 함께한 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/09-disneyland-together.webp\"/><span><b>DISNEYLAND</b><small>FIVE OF US, ONE PERFECT DAY.</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/10-rollercoaster.webp\" data-title=\"DISNEYLAND · ROLLER COASTER\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"롤러코스터를 타는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/10-rollercoaster.webp\"/><span><b>DISNEYLAND</b><small>ROLLER COASTER</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/11-pirates.webp\" data-title=\"DISNEYLAND · PIRATES\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Pirates of the Caribbean을 즐기는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/11-pirates.webp\"/><span><b>DISNEYLAND</b><small>PIRATES</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/12-mad-tea-party.webp\" data-title=\"DISNEYLAND · MAD TEA PARTY\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Mad Tea Party를 즐기는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/12-mad-tea-party.webp\"/><span><b>DISNEYLAND</b><small>MAD TEA PARTY</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/13-tianas-bayou.webp\" data-title=\"DISNEYLAND · TIANA'S BAYOU\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Tiana's Bayou Adventure를 즐기는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/13-tianas-bayou.webp\"/><span><b>DISNEYLAND</b><small>TIANA'S BAYOU</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo travel-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/14-fireworks.webp\" data-title=\"DISNEYLAND · FIREWORKS\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"디즈니랜드 불꽃놀이를 보는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/14-fireworks.webp\"/><span><b>DISNEYLAND</b><small>FIREWORKS</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo travel-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/15-beach.webp\" data-title=\"LOS ANGELES · BEACH\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"로스앤젤레스 해변의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/15-beach.webp\"/><span><b>BEACH</b><small>SOMEWHERE BETWEEN THE WAVES AND THE NIGHT.</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/16-hollywood.webp\" data-title=\"HOLLYWOOD · CITY LIGHTS\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"할리우드를 여행하는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/16-hollywood.webp\"/><span><b>HOLLYWOOD</b><small>CITY LIGHTS</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/17-hollywood-night.webp\" data-title=\"HOLLYWOOD · AFTER DARK\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"할리우드의 밤을 걷는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/17-hollywood-night.webp\"/><span><b>HOLLYWOOD</b><small>AFTER DARK</small></span></button>\n</div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"travel-chapter section\" id=\"las-vegas\">\n<div class=\"container\"><div class=\"travel-chapter-head reveal\"><div><span>CHAPTER 03</span><h2>Las Vegas</h2></div><p>ANOTHER CITY, ANOTHER NIGHT.</p></div>\n<div class=\"travel-grid travel-grid-three\">\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/18-las-vegas.webp\" data-title=\"LAS VEGAS · NEON ARRIVAL\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"라스베이거스에 도착한 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/18-las-vegas.webp\"/><span><b>LAS VEGAS</b><small>NEON ARRIVAL</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/19-las-vegas-night.webp\" data-title=\"LAS VEGAS · AFTER MIDNIGHT\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"라스베이거스의 밤을 즐기는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/19-las-vegas-night.webp\"/><span><b>LAS VEGAS</b><small>AFTER MIDNIGHT</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/20-las-vegas-together.webp\" data-title=\"LAS VEGAS · TOGETHER\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"라스베이거스에서 함께한 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/20-las-vegas-together.webp\"/><span><b>LAS VEGAS</b><small>TOGETHER</small></span></button>\n</div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"travel-chapter section\" id=\"new-york\">\n<div class=\"container\"><div class=\"travel-chapter-head reveal\"><div><span>CHAPTER 04</span><h2>New York</h2></div><p>WE CROSSED THE CITY LIKE A DREAM.</p></div>\n<div class=\"travel-grid\">\n<button class=\"travel-photo travel-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/21-new-york.webp\" data-title=\"NEW YORK · FIRST VIEW\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"뉴욕에 도착한 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/21-new-york.webp\"/><span><b>NEW YORK</b><small>FIRST VIEW</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/22-new-york-street.webp\" data-title=\"NEW YORK · CITY WALK\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"뉴욕 거리를 걷는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/22-new-york-street.webp\"/><span><b>NEW YORK</b><small>CITY WALK</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/23-central-park.webp\" data-title=\"NEW YORK · CENTRAL PARK\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"센트럴파크의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/23-central-park.webp\"/><span><b>NEW YORK</b><small>CENTRAL PARK</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo travel-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/24-brooklyn-bridge.webp\" data-title=\"NEW YORK · BROOKLYN BRIDGE\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"브루클린 브리지의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/24-brooklyn-bridge.webp\"/><span><b>NEW YORK</b><small>BROOKLYN BRIDGE</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/25-broadway.webp\" data-title=\"NEW YORK · BROADWAY\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"브로드웨이의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/25-broadway.webp\"/><span><b>NEW YORK</b><small>BROADWAY</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/26-empire-tower.webp\" data-title=\"NEW YORK · EMPIRE TOWER\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"엠파이어 타워를 찾은 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/26-empire-tower.webp\"/><span><b>NEW YORK</b><small>EMPIRE TOWER</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo travel-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/27-new-york-hotel.webp\" data-title=\"NEW YORK · LAST NIGHT\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"뉴욕 호텔의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/27-new-york-hotel.webp\"/><span><b>NEW YORK</b><small>LAST NIGHT</small></span></button>\n</div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"travel-chapter section\" id=\"return\">\n<div class=\"container\"><div class=\"travel-chapter-head reveal\"><div><span>CHAPTER 05</span><h2>Return</h2></div><p>HOME, WITH MORE MEMORIES THAN LUGGAGE.</p></div>\n<div class=\"travel-grid travel-grid-three\">\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/28-hotel-checkout.webp\" data-title=\"RETURN · CHECK-OUT\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"호텔 체크아웃을 하는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/28-hotel-checkout.webp\"/><span><b>RETURN</b><small>CHECK-OUT</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/29-flight-home.webp\" data-title=\"RETURN · HOMEBOUND\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"한국행 비행기에 오른 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/29-flight-home.webp\"/><span><b>RETURN</b><small>HOMEBOUND</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"travel-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/30-incheon-arrival.webp\" data-title=\"INCHEON · HOME AGAIN\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"인천공항에 입국한 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/30-incheon-arrival.webp\"/><span><b>INCHEON</b><small>HOME AGAIN</small></span></button>\n</div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"travel-epilogue section\" id=\"epilogue\">\n<div class=\"container travel-epilogue-grid reveal\">\n<button class=\"travel-epilogue-photo travel-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/travel/full/31-interview.webp\" data-title=\"EPILOGUE · INTERVIEW\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"여행을 마친 NIGHT의 인터뷰\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/travel/thumbs/31-interview.webp\"/><span><b>EPILOGUE</b><small>INTERVIEW</small></span></button>\n<div><span class=\"section-kicker\">EPILOGUE · INTERVIEW</span><h2>The memory stays.</h2><p>무대를 잠시 벗어나 같은 풍경을 보고, 같은 길을 걸었던 다섯 멤버. 여행은 끝났지만 그 밤의 장면들은 NIGHT의 또 다른 기록으로 남는다.</p><blockquote>THE TRIP ENDS.<br/>THE MEMORY STAYS.</blockquote></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-label=\"여행 이미지 확대 보기\" aria-modal=\"true\" class=\"travel-lightbox\" id=\"travelLightbox\" role=\"dialog\">\n<button aria-label=\"닫기\" class=\"travel-lightbox-close\" type=\"button\">×</button><button aria-label=\"이전 이미지\" class=\"travel-lightbox-nav travel-lightbox-prev\" type=\"button\">‹</button>\n<div class=\"travel-lightbox-stage\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"travel-lightbox-image\" src=\"\"/><div class=\"travel-lightbox-meta\"><span class=\"travel-lightbox-title\"></span><span class=\"travel-lightbox-index\"></span></div></div>\n<button aria-label=\"다음 이미지\" class=\"travel-lightbox-nav travel-lightbox-next\" type=\"button\">›</button>\n</div>\n",
